1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,776
Meet HearMe. A shared conversation between passengers and cabin crew, across languages.

2
00:00:08,876 --> 00:00:15,501
Passengers keep a familiar interface. Tap a picture, type a request, or hold

3
00:00:15,501 --> 00:00:17,540
the microphone and speak.

4
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:27,082
Online mode starts with explicit consent. Saaras recognizes speech, Groq understands requests, and

5
00:00:27,082 --> 00:00:29,680
Sarvam translates supported languages.

6
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:36,060
Here, the passenger types in Hindi: I would like some hot water.

7
00:00:37,160 --> 00:00:43,170
After confirmation, the crew receives the hot water request in Japanese and English,

8
00:00:43,170 --> 00:00:45,944
with the passenger seat clearly identified.

9
00:00:47,044 --> 00:00:52,414
The crew replies with one tap. The passenger reads the reply in Hindi

10
00:00:52,414 --> 00:00:54,892
and can hear it through Bulbul.

11
00:00:55,492 --> 00:00:56,929
[Hindi crew reply]

12
00:00:58,129 --> 00:01:03,855
What if a request has no category? This passenger asks for rum and

13
00:01:03,855 --> 00:01:05,617
whisky in Roman Hindi.

14
00:01:06,717 --> 00:01:12,511
It arrives as Other request: I want rum and whiskey. The original words

15
00:01:12,511 --> 00:01:16,077
stay visible, and a crew member can respond.

16
00:01:17,177 --> 00:01:25,351
Choose from fifteen languages. Ten Indian languages and English support online processing. Japanese,

17
00:01:25,351 --> 00:01:29,753
Thai, Indonesian and Vietnamese retain local processing.

18
00:01:30,853 --> 00:01:37,258
The same cabin announcement appears in the seatback language. Here is the meal

19
00:01:37,258 --> 00:01:39,229
service announcement in Tamil.

20
00:01:39,829 --> 00:01:42,206
[Meal service announcement in Tamil]

21
00:01:43,406 --> 00:01:49,958
Switch back to Offline mode for the original local models. Fixed announcements have

22
00:01:49,958 --> 00:01:52,982
bundled recordings in all fifteen languages.

23
00:01:54,082 --> 00:02:01,762
HearMe brings passenger requests, crew replies and multilingual announcements into one connected experience.

